ls="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">t generate revenue during the three or six months ended June 30, 2026 or the comparable periods in 2025.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
